      "uid": "zhcn:89199b1953847c61d6b1b186",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对她身上接二连三发生的怪事，\n训练员也只能耐心地在一旁辅助，\n并绞尽脑汁来应对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0eb34c3dfb41773667402405b70359c85f545429090c0d8f0f84bb509d9cc96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
