    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2e61fc6049ca53551667c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”结束的几天后──\n爱丽速子突然召开记者会，\n宣布自己将“无限期停赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87eab6bbca5e5d845a09f562ed37325557d838375b8c7a360cb8fda7eebaeea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b012391e6046e726bca1a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子虽错过了“皋月赏”，但还是非常有望\n取得剩下的两冠。究竟是为什么……\n然而她没有多说，记者会也就此结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7102fd209f875feb1fe7ee17a16406f9709db2b406cabbf4fad26011f06c84eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a0ae1d9298c8f884d93251",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子以惊人的速度拿下了“皋月赏”，\n甚至非常有望取得三冠。究竟是为什么……\n然而她没有多说，记者会也就此结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cae1f00c5afa9da6ca79ca5d3641850f63fb7ee9dbde16cfc7b683ecd711517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
