      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，令人意外地，\n爱丽速子竟表示\n想要成为曼城茶座的“顾问”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddc4ac473c7d6022a7a86de38f5410510e79fda60f6fde4c1cd466fe3ff9a1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
